From 777b461fbef240f983ca4a806fd2dae14a175bc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:30:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] Big screens: Stage Console control card + DJ booth
 modal

- Card redesigned as a vision-mixer: tally (Lobby / On air), PROGRAM monitor
  with a live lobby preview, F1-F4 scene keys (Lobby, Code on lobby, DJ booth, Event)
- Share code as flip-in digit tiles; copy feedback; quick 'Show on screen'
- Projector link blurred until revealed (copy still copies the real URL)
- Sources section: event background, Music & video row, Event fold;
  add-ons mount into [data-addons]
- Music & video now opens a DJ booth modal: spinning record with the
  YouTube thumbnail as label, tone arm, EQ, full media controls + queue
